{`v`:`story_v1`,`room`:`DEGREE`,`title`:`Maybe Tomorrow`,`titleVN`:`C\u00f3 l\u1ebd ng\u00e0y mai`,`cast`:[{`name`:`Khang`,`vn`:`c\u1eadu b\u00e9 13 tu\u1ed5i \u1edf s\u1ed1 2, m\u00ea d\u1ef1 \u0111o\u00e1n v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1nh c\u01b0\u1ee3c cho vui`},{`name`:`Duy`,`vn`:`b\u1ea1n th\u00e2n 13 tu\u1ed5i c\u1ee7a Khang, r\u1ea5t th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf`}],`ch`:[{`floor`:`A1`,`part`:1,`parts`:1,`title`:`Maybe, Probably, Sure`,`titleVN`:`C\u00f3 l\u1ebd, ch\u1eafc l\u00e0, ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn`,`words`:`main|too|maybe|probably|sure|quite|possible|really|important`,`paras`:[{`en`:`Khang [[is|be]] [[thirteen]] [[and]] [[lives|live]] [[at]] [[number]] 2, Lotus Street. [[He]] [[loves|love]] [[guessing|guess]] [[what]] [[happens|happen]] [[next]]. [[Every]] [[morning]], [[his]] [[main]] [[question]] [[is|be]]: [[what]] [[happens|happen]] [[today]]? [[His]] [[best]] [[friend]], Duy, [[does|do]] [[not]] [[guess]]. Duy [[looks|look]] [[first]]. \`[[He]] [[thinks|think]] [[too]] [[much]],\` [[says|say]] Khang.`,`vn`:`Khang m\u01b0\u1eddi ba tu\u1ed5i, nh\u00e0 \u1edf s\u1ed1 2 ph\u1ed1 Hoa Sen. C\u1eadu m\u00ea \u0111o\u00e1n tr\u01b0\u1edbc xem chuy\u1ec7n g\u00ec s\u1eafp x\u1ea3y ra. S\u00e1ng n\u00e0o c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a c\u1eadu c\u0169ng l\u00e0: h\u00f4m nay s\u1ebd c\u00f3 chuy\u1ec7n g\u00ec? Duy, b\u1ea1n th\u00e2n c\u1ee7a c\u1eadu, th\u00ec ch\u1eb3ng bao gi\u1edd \u0111o\u00e1n. Duy quan s\u00e1t tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00e3. \`C\u1eadu \u1ea5y ngh\u0129 nhi\u1ec1u qu\u00e1,\` Khang b\u1ea3o.`},{`en`:`\`[[It]] [[is|be]] [[going|go]] [[to]] [[rain]] [[at]] [[four]],\` [[says|say]] Khang. \`[[Maybe]],\` [[says|say]] Duy. \`[[Not]] [[maybe]],\` [[says|say]] Khang. \`[[Probably]]. [[No]], [[I]] [[am|be]] [[sure]]!\` [[At]] [[four]], [[the]] [[sky]] [[is|be]] [[blue]]. [[At]] [[five]], [[it]] [[rains|rain]]. \`[[See]]?\` [[says|say]] Khang. \`[[The]] [[rain]] [[is|be]] [[only]] [[a]] [[little]] [[late]].\``,`vn`:`\`B\u1ed1n gi\u1edd tr\u1eddi s\u1ebd m\u01b0a,\` Khang n\u00f3i. \`C\u00f3 l\u1ebd,\` Duy \u0111\u00e1p. \`Kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i c\u00f3 l\u1ebd,\` Khang n\u00f3i. \`Ch\u1eafc l\u00e0. \u00c0 kh\u00f4ng, ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn lu\u00f4n!\` B\u1ed1n gi\u1edd, tr\u1eddi xanh ng\u1eaft. N\u0103m gi\u1edd, tr\u1eddi m\u1edbi m\u01b0a. \`Th\u1ea5y ch\u01b0a?\` Khang n\u00f3i. \`C\u01a1n m\u01b0a ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ebfn mu\u1ed9n m\u1ed9t ch\u00fat th\u00f4i.\``},{`en`:`[[The]] [[friends|friend]] [[have]] [[a]] [[game]] [[with]] [[one]] [[main]] [[rule]]: [[no]] [[phones|phone]]. [[When]] Khang [[is|be]] [[right]], Duy [[buys|buy]] [[him]] an [[ice cream]]. [[When]] [[he]] [[is|be]] [[wrong]], Khang [[buys|buy]]. Khang [[eats|eat]] [[quite]] [[a]] [[lot]] [[of]] [[ice cream]]. [[He]] [[buys|buy]] [[quite]] [[a]] [[lot]] [[too]].`,`vn`:`Hai c\u1eadu b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t tr\u00f2 ch\u01a1i v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t lu\u1eadt ch\u00ednh: kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c xem \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i. Khang \u0111o\u00e1n \u0111\u00fang th\u00ec Duy mua kem cho c\u1eadu. \u0110o\u00e1n sai th\u00ec Khang ph\u1ea3i mua. Khang \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0103n kem kh\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u. M\u00e0 c\u1eadu c\u0169ng ph\u1ea3i mua kem kh\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u.`},{`en`:`\`[[Is|be]] [[it]] [[possible]] [[to]] [[be]] [[right]] [[every]] [[time]]?\` [[asks|ask]] Duy. \`[[Anything]] [[is|be]] [[possible]],\` [[says|say]] Khang. \`[[Really]]?\` \`[[Really]]. [[Guessing|guess]] [[is|be]] [[the]] [[most]] [[important]] [[thing]] [[in]] [[the]] [[world]].\``,`vn`:`\`Li\u1ec7u c\u00f3 ai \u0111o\u00e1n \u0111\u00fang m\u00e3i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng?\` Duy h\u1ecfi. \`Chuy\u1ec7n g\u00ec c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3,\` Khang n\u00f3i. \`Th\u1eadt kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea5y?\` \`Th\u1eadt. \u0110o\u00e1n l\u00e0 vi\u1ec7c quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t tr\u00ean \u0111\u1eddi.\``},{`en`:`[[On]] [[Friday]], Khang [[has|have]] [[a]] [[big]] [[idea]]. \`[[The]] Lotus Street [[football]] [[team]] [[plays|play]] [[tomorrow]]. [[They]] [[will]] [[probably]] [[win]]. [[No]], [[I]] [[am|be]] [[sure]]! [[If]] [[they]] [[lose]], [[I]] [[will]] [[carry]] [[your]] [[school]] [[bag]] [[for]] [[a]] [[week]].\` Duy [[smiles|smile]]. [[There]] [[are|be]] [[nine]] [[big]] [[books|book]] [[in]] [[his]] [[bag]]. \`[[OK]],\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[But]] [[it]] [[is|be]] an [[important]] [[bag]].\``,`vn`:`Th\u1ee9 S\u00e1u, Khang n\u1ea3y ra m\u1ed9t \u00fd l\u1edbn. \`Mai \u0111\u1ed9i b\u00f3ng ph\u1ed1 Hoa Sen \u0111\u00e1. Ch\u1eafc l\u00e0 s\u1ebd th\u1eafng. \u00c0 kh\u00f4ng, ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn lu\u00f4n! N\u1ebfu \u0111\u1ed9i thua, t\u1edb x\u00e1ch c\u1eb7p cho c\u1eadu m\u1ed9t tu\u1ea7n.\` Duy m\u1ec9m c\u01b0\u1eddi. Trong c\u1eb7p c\u1ee7a Duy c\u00f3 ch\u00edn quy\u1ec3n s\u00e1ch d\u00e0y c\u1ed9p. \`\u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00f4i,\` Duy n\u00f3i. \`Nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1i c\u1eb7p quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ea5y.\``}],`tease`:`\u0110\u1ed9i b\u00f3ng ph\u1ed1 Hoa Sen c\u00f3 th\u1eafng nh\u01b0 Khang ch\u1eafc m\u1ea9m, hay c\u1eadu s\u1ebd ph\u1ea3i x\u00e1ch chi\u1ebfc c\u1eb7p ch\u00edn quy\u1ec3n s\u00e1ch?`}]}